{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious swimming pool. Observe the surroundings for any abnormalities and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape method</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not ignore any abnormalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an abnormality, immediately return to the pool entrance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no abnormalities are found, proceed to the pool exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all abnormalities are discovered, find the real Pool No. 8 and leave through the exit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special tip</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not have particularly scary abnormal designs, so you can play with peace of mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game duration is about 2 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are approximately 30 abnormalities in total.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an anomaly-finding game inspired by \u201cExit 8\u201d and \u201cFalseMall.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also my first independently completed beginner project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level of game production still needs practice and improvement, so I ask for your understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in anomaly-finding games, please add it to your wishlist. Thank you very much! This is a great encouragement for new developers!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Discovered?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603690/12e0f9d8851aadb6f8569752a4ce8556e4f69e8f.jpg"},{"name":"Awesome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603690/b8f8e9973acc92221e1e37434a794ee7a13ca3cf.jpg"},{"name":"Respect!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3603690/b223c54478187936ba9102b8c9ed802c1369bda1.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603690?t=1750780085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603690/de6139c21c3b2ffa927ac1155d4796c07243fd71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750780085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603690/5c503c49c5b278eb076feaed1426b6c943cfc539/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750780085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603690/5c503c49c5b278eb076feaed1426b6c943cfc539/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750780085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3656120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious swimming pool. Observe the surroundings for any abnormalities and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape method</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not ignore any abnormalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an abnormality, immediately return to the pool entrance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no abnormalities are found, proceed to the pool exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all abnormalities are discovered, find the real Pool No. 8 and leave through the exit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special tip</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not have particularly scary abnormal designs, so you can play with peace of mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game duration is about 2 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are approximately 30 abnormalities in total.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an anomaly-finding game inspired by \u201cExit 8\u201d and \u201cFalseMall.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also my first independently completed beginner project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level of game production still needs practice and improvement, so I ask for your understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in anomaly-finding games, please add it to your wishlist. Thank you very much! This is a great encouragement for new developers!</p>","developers":["orange\u8001\u674e"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603690/0bb20c4322e2843d8a63bf2b4c27b089ba0acc11/header.jpg?t=1750780085","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603690/855465/ca1b4ca20e6c07cfca7e055dd5a300c46c8c5df5/1750448701/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749540193","dash_h264":"htt